{"parentUuid":"521e205f-3fe7-456c-8421-78181f16ef6d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f4fa8f31-9c5b-4d4e-8353-0ad78a70622f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<command-message>loop</command-message>\n<command-name>/loop</command-name>\n<command-args>continue until v1.2.0 release</command-args>"},"uuid":"279bc144-1fb2-4baa-ab74-4b3715f40c00","timestamp":"2026-11-15T08:04:05.995Z","wakeupSource":"loop_wakeup","scheduledTaskId":"894724da","scheduledFireId":"521e205f-3fe7-456c-8421-78181f16ef6d","turnOrigin":"scheduled","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":78,"turnIndex":494},"queuePriority":"later","queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
{"parentUuid":"279bc144-1fb2-4baa-ab74-4b3715f40c00","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f4fa8f31-9c5b-4d4e-8353-0ad78a70622f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /home/mike/.claude/skills/loop\n\n# /loop\nParse input as `[interval] <prompt>`: a first token matching ^\\d+[smhd]$ is the interval; else a trailing `every <N> <unit>` (only when a time follows \"every\"); else no interval (dynamic). Empty prompt → print `/loop [interval] <prompt>` and stop.\n\n## Fixed interval\nCron: Nm≤59 → `*/N * * * *`; Nm≥60 or Nh → `0 */H * * *`; Nd → `0 0 */N * *`; Ns → round up to minutes. Round uneven intervals to the nearest clean one and say so. CronCreate (recurring: true), confirm cadence + job ID in one line (expires after 7 days; cancel with CronDelete), then run the prompt now.\n\n## Dynamic\n1. Run the prompt now (slash command → Skill tool).\n2. If the next run waits on an event, arm one Monitor (timeout_ms 1800000) unless TaskList shows one running.\n3. If work remains: ScheduleWakeup with prompt `/loop <original input>`, delaySeconds 1200–1800 unless something specific changes sooner, noop true when nothing changed. Re-arming is a choice, not a default.\n4. Confirm in one short visible line.\n5. To stop: ScheduleWakeup stop:true, TaskStop any Monitor, one-line PushNotification (skip if the user asked to stop), then write the outcome.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: continue until v1.2.0 release"}]},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"a5042422-22af-4f3c-976b-f4c957a6d862","timestamp":"2026-11-15T08:04:05.995Z","wakeupSource":"loop_wakeup","queuePriority":"later","queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
