{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","hash":"d1bfa3fe74d6c3592519e3a2f05521349b180f61ee374a9bcd2e173233470235","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RtKqJyrZkd9YYWfFTktqHP","type":"tool_result","content":"```\n\nWithout `NEXUS_VERSION`, the installer follows the latest stable release. If no stable release has been published yet, the installer exits with a hint to select a prerelease tag from [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases). To i\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/main/install.sh | NEXUS_VERSION=v1.2.0-rc.1 sh\n```\n\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/main/install.sh | NEXUS_VERSION=v1.1.4 sh\n```\nShell cwd was reset to /home/mike/nexus-code","is_error":false}]}}
