{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","id":"05fe6cc8-cb6a-4735-8142-cc6375562e97","timestamp":"2026-11-15T12:41:27.503Z","version":"2.1.323","querySource":"repl_main_thread","shapeHash":"02245c82d4cb86350db44b7c9960d5f359fa3c3746ce766c103fc6f328b1a703","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"64ba9bdb-32cd-4958-b642-1543f7aed94f","keep":639,"tail":["630d032a3a9f47e7a9f6d309692287920288979c66ecebfb4226f4d1bf74c427","c04564995f39878ce23e7bdfe8138e8f7235a4fbc181f030284e0064e6a9a430","d04cc38be9eb2fb2deb58e608aa9f1ac52d1a7c059ebdd18120aff527224bfa1"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",641,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"4378931d49dc8e2467cc6bbaf3ac655aa8f0d854fa333d5ee3399944ad3c2950"}
{"parentUuid":"89bc2ce7-195c-4327-88f8-b53686827a38","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch4jMANLFjSJ2sQKPibUU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"v1.2.0 is published as the latest stable release, with G1.1-4 recorded as not met and external qualification pending. I made no frontier-grade claim, and the draft body and README both state the limitation.\n\n**What I verified on the published release**\n- **Tag:** it was never moved or recreated. It still points at `d6075b8d`, on the version-only commit `f1ad33b9`, which is now an ancestor of `main` via #524.\n- **Release run:** the re-run (attempt 3) succeeded.\n- **Assets:** all nine assets are present, and the tarball, `compatibility.json` and SBOM checksums pass.\n- **Attestations:** both the tarball and `SHA256SUMS` verify, signed by this repo at `refs/tags/v1.2.0` for commit `f1ad33b9d6c8`.\n- **Install:** the real `install.sh` ran against the public release with attestation required. It installed v1.2.0, and the binary reports `1.2.0 (f1ad33b9d6c8)`.\n\n**`main` and the PRs**\n- **#523 and #514:** both merged, the G1.1-4 evidence record and the doc-drift fix. #519, which has the watchdog fix, is re-running CI.\n- **`main` CI:** it was green on `e781bf29`. The runs on the two merges just now are still in progress.\n- **#519:** I found and fixed a real bug in the new test driver: on Node 22 its per-file hang watchdog was never armed, so a hung file wouldn't have been killed on the Node 22 CI jobs. The fix is pushed (`28d3b8cf`) and passes on Node 22 and 24.\n- **PR #526:** the post-stable docs follow-up moves `LATEST`, the README and quickstart pins, and the CHANGELOG date to v1.2.0. It waits on CI.\n\nI'll merge #526 and #519 when their required checks are green at the exact head."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":756,"cache_read_input_tokens":326076,"output_tokens":637,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":756,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":637,"cache_read_input_tokens":326076,"cache_creation_input_tokens":756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":756},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch4jMA4V8GfTRQCF2ydnv","requestRef":"05fe6cc8-cb6a-4735-8142-cc6375562e97","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"776c393b-7d28-4fd1-9977-b6200afe4e87","timestamp":"2026-11-15T12:41:32.279Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
